Output contract — return one turn:
- `speaker`: always "agent".
- `content`: your reply (1–6 sentences).
- `done`: boolean (see above).
- `done_reason`: short tag when done, else null.
- `commitments`: promises you make in this turn, each `{who, what, due}` — `who` is "agent" or whoever will act (e.g. "field technician"), `what` the action, `due` the time as you said it (or null). An empty list if you promise nothing. They are not shown in the transcript; record exactly what your words promise.
